    {
        "text": "11:11 A.M \u00a0 Weather/Drizzle",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "text": "Outside of Muk Wo Warehouse, Sam Cheong Chai, Central Lungmen",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The scouting is more or less complete. Our observation spot is stealthy enough, and there's nobody around the warehouse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like it's an abandoned construction site with piles of construction materials left behind. There are traces of things being dragged around.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion must have set up an ambush here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ch'en, is Ah Faat your informant?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Yes. Did you overhear our conversation?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I tried my best not to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'e known him for a long time, more than 10 years. There's no way I wouldn't recognize his voice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "When did you make him a informant?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "He was infected more than a year ago. At that time, he disappeared from his bar, leaving the glasses he cleaned every day unattended and covered in dust.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe even before that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You at least should have told me about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like it's about to rain. Let's get started and chase the enemies out of their ambush spots.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sigh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're too late. He's going to bleed out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll draw Reunion's fire. The rest of you should seize the opportunity to surround them and end this battle quickly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Too dangerous.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But it's the fastest way to win. You can trust me on this one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I always trust you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Follow Hoshiguma's instructions. Make it quick.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yessir!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
